# Standardize on LF in the repo. The Dart formatter and openapi-generator
# always write LF, so pinning it here avoids CRLF/LF churn every time the
# SDK is regenerated on Windows (where core.autocrlf=true would otherwise
# convert on checkout and produce spurious "modified" status entries).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types that must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
